<title>UK: Cr.Lyonnais sets warrants on HSBC Holdings.</title>
<headline>Cr.Lyonnais sets warrants on HSBC Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guurnsey) has issued 80 million American-style put warrants on HSBC Holdings, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100 PCT OF REF PRICE  PREMIUM	12.00 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.2 PCT OF REF PRICE  GEARING	8.33 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	17.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	**</p>
<p> LISTING APPLIED-HONG KONG EXCHANGE    MIN EXC	4000</p>
<p> NOTES	     ** TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
